<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Jan 24, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Jan 24   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,947    2,914 10,395</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     151	147    331</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    838	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 3,936    3,924 12,032</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,271    1,503   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     270	296   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,558    3,558   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,099    5,357   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
